# Findings

## High — Pi UI check does not actually verify the waveform

Phase 1 says Pi convergence requires the expected waveform, but `assert_ui_text` represents it with `\S+`. Any non-whitespace token between the marker and title therefore passes, even if the music dock waveform is absent or replaced by unrelated text. Require the actual Pi waveform shape (the dock renders 16 characters from `▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█`) while continuing to ignore artist and album.
